      "updated": 1791493015319,
      "created": 1791487059176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "very important, so that random numbers \nbecome something insightful like\n[\n    {\n        \"metric\": \"purchase_button_clicks\",\n        \"thisMonth\": 44,\n        \"prevMonth\": 50,\n        \"delta\": -6\n    }, \n    { \n        \"metric\": \"page_visits\",\n        \"thisMonth\": 470,\n        \"prevMonth\": 400,\n        \"delta\": 70\n]",
