      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791493015319,
      "created": 1791487901109,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "given this structured data, \ngenerate a list of statements\nin the form\n<observation>, <evidence?>, <hypothesis>:\n[\n    \"purchases went down 6 even though page visits went up 70, possibly UX improvement\",\n    \"40 no op clicks in the contact us page, UI broken found in codebase, UI fix\"\n]\nideally, as specific as possible to have more context for the instruction; point\nto specific parts of the code for example.",
      "fontSize": 13.60822852974166,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "given this structured data, \ngenerate a list of statements\nin the form\n<observation>, <evidence?>, <hypothesis>:\n[\n    \"purchases went down 6 even though page visits went up 70, possibly UX improvement\",\n    \"40 no op clicks in the contact us page, UI broken found in codebase, UI fix\"\n]\nideally, as specific as possible to have more context for the instruction; point\nto specific parts of the code for example.",
